    </section>

    <details class="card menu-card" id="basicSettingsPanel">
      <summary class="menu-summary">
        <div class="summary-main"><span class="summary-no">2</span><div><b>기본 설정</b><small>치구번호, 재질, Ø, 최대 장수, 결과 표시 방식</small></div></div>
        <span class="summary-arrow">⌄</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="menu-content">
        <div class="form-grid">
          <label>라인 코드
            <select id="lineCodeSelect"></select>
          </label>
          <label>번호 입력 방식
            <select id="numberingMode">
              <option value="continuous" selected>연속 자동</option>
              <option value="individual">개별 입력</option>
            </select>
